  <UMW_Cut_Ragged.label>撕裂割傷</UMW_Cut_Ragged.label>

  <!-- EN: a ragged cut -->
  <UMW_Cut_Ragged.labelNoun>撕裂割傷</UMW_Cut_Ragged.labelNoun>

  <!-- EN: A ragged, torn cut that bleeds freely and scars badly. -->
  <UMW_Cut_Ragged.description>一道參差撕裂的割傷，出血不止，且極易留下難看的疤痕。</UMW_Cut_Ragged.description>

