  <!-- EN: rallied -->
  <UMW_Rallied.label>士氣大振</UMW_Rallied.label>

  <!-- EN: Stirred by a rallying cry. For a time, pain is dulled and staggering blows are quickly shaken off. -->
  <UMW_Rallied.description>受到鼓舞吶喊的激勵。一段時間內，疼痛會減輕，受擊踉蹌後也能很快恢復。</UMW_Rallied.description>


  <!-- EN: sedative buildup -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.label>鎮靜劑累積</UMW_SedativeBuildup.label>

  <!-- EN: A fast-acting sedative building up in the bloodstream. At high levels it renders creatures unconscious. -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.description>一種在血液中不斷累積的速效鎮靜劑。濃度過高時會使生物失去意識。</UMW_SedativeBuildup.description>

  <!-- EN: dosed -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.stages.0.label>輕微</UMW_SedativeBuildup.stages.0.label>

  <!-- EN: woozy -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.stages.1.label>恍惚</UMW_SedativeBuildup.stages.1.label>

  <!-- EN: sedated -->
  <UMW_SedativeBuildup.stages.2.label>鎮靜</UMW_SedativeBuildup.stages.2.label>


